- `MediaStorageProviderSchema`: `'cloudinary' | 's3' | 'local' | 'external'`
- `CloudinaryConfigSchema`: `cloudName: string`, `folder: string.default('portal-assets')`, `secure: boolean.default(true)`
- `S3ConfigSchema`: `bucket: string`, `region: string`, `endpoint?: string`, `publicUrlBase?: string`
- `LocalStorageConfigSchema`: `basePath: string.default('/media')`
- `MediaStorageSchema`: `provider`, `cloudinary`, `s3`, `local`
- `MediaItemSchema`: `id`, `title`, `councilId`, `mediaPath`, `durationMinutes`, `thumbnailPath`, `captionSummary`
- `MediaSchema`: `storage`, `heroBackgroundVideo`, `heroFallbackPoster`, `ambientAudioSoundscapeUrl?: string`, `miniDocumentaries: MediaItemSchema[]`
- `FCTFieldProjectSchema`: `id`, `title`, `category` ('education' | 'healthcare' | 'agriculture' | 'water_sanitation' | 'idp_resilience'), `settlementName`, `settlementType`, `beneficiariesCount`, `status`, `description`, `mediaPath?`
- `FCTAreaCouncilDataSchema`: `id`, `name`, `headquarters`, `terrainType`, `populationServed`, `activeProjects`, `coordinates`, `fieldDispatchLead`
- `OrganizationSchema`: `legalName`, `tradingName`, `acronym`, `tagline`, `mission`, `vision`, `foundingYear`, `headquartersAddress`, `email`, `phone`, `whatsappNumber`
- `BrandingSchema`: `logoUrl`, `logoAlt`, `crestSvgPath?`, `faviconUrl`, `primaryColorHex`, `themeMode`
- `GovernanceSchema`: `cacNumber`, `scumlNumber`, `firsTin`, `taxExemptionCitation`, `incorporationDate`, `trustees`, `auditedFinancialYear`, `financialAllocation`, `annualReportPdfUrl`
- `BankingSchema`: `ngnAccount`, `domiciliaryAccounts`, `digitalGateways`, `donationTiers`
