- `NGOConfigSchema`: Root composite schema validating the entire data tree.

#### 3.3 Dynamic Config Loader with Environment Overrides (`src/lib/config-loader.ts`)
- Loads all modular files from `content/`.
- Deeply merges environment variable overrides:
  - `NEXT_PUBLIC_NGO_NAME` -> `organization.tradingName`
  - `NEXT_PUBLIC_NGO_LEGAL_NAME` -> `organization.legalName`
  - `NEXT_PUBLIC_NGO_WHATSAPP` -> `organization.whatsappNumber` & `banking.ngnAccount.whatsappConfirmationPhone`
  - `MEDIA_STORAGE_PROVIDER` -> `media.storage.provider`
  - `NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME` -> `media.storage.cloudinary.cloudName`
  - `LOCAL_MEDIA_BASE_PATH` -> `media.storage.local.basePath`
  - `S3_BUCKET_NAME` -> `media.storage.s3.bucket`
- Validates via `NGOConfigSchema.safeParse(...)`. Fails fast with clear error messages if any data fails schema checks.
- Provides `writeNGOConfig(updatedConfig: NGOConfig)` for the Content Studio (`/admin`) and in-memory cache invalidation.

